228,230,[5],&quot;style=width: 100%; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); padding: 0rem 2rem 0rem 4rem;&quot;,232,228,231,[5],&quot;style=width: 100%; background-color: rgb(228, 237, 241); padding: 0rem 2rem 0rem 4rem;&quot;,233,228,232,[5],&quot;class=walkthrough-container&quot;,&quot;style=background-color: rgba(239, 239, 239, 0.937); padding: 3rem 6rem;&quot;,234,229,&quot;NAV&quot;,&quot;class=nav-breadcrumb&quot;,235,230,[5],&quot;style=display: flex; height: 400px; margin: 0px auto 0px 2rem;&quot;,236,231,[5],&quot;class=about-container&quot;,237,232,[5],&quot;class=about-container-2&quot;,&quot;style=background-color: rgb(228, 237, 241);&quot;,238,233,[5],&quot;class=wt-c1&quot;,239,233,238,[5],&quot;class=wt-tabs-center wt-tabs-and-iframe&quot;,&quot;style=display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 2rem; position: relative;&quot;,240,234,&quot;A&quot;,&quot;href=/sandbox-ui/TESTTWELVE/employee/sandbox/productPage&quot;,241,234,240,&quot;SPAN&quot;,&quot;class=separator&quot;,242,234,241,[69],&quot;class=current&quot;,243,235,[5],&quot;style=margin-left: 2rem; width: 50%; padding-right: 2rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center;&quot;,244,235,243,[5],&quot;style=width: 65%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: flex-end;&quot;,245,236,[5],&quot;class=about-title-wrapper&quot;,246,236,245,&quot;P&quot;,&quot;class=about-description&quot;,247,236,246,[5],&quot;class=roles-column-align&quot;,248,237,[5,88],249,237,248,[92,93],250,237,249,[5],&quot;class=cs-wrapper-align&quot;,251,237,250,[5,110],252,238,&quot;H2&quot;,&quot;class=wt-title&quot;,253,238,252,[92],&quot;class=wt-subtitle&quot;,254,239,[5],&quot;class=wt-tab-wrapper&quot;,&quot;style=margin-bottom: -2rem; display: flex; justify-content: flex-start; width: auto; position: absolute; top: 0px; left: 0px; z-index: 10;&quot;,255,239,254,[5],&quot;class=wt-iframe-wrapper h-full w-full relative overflow-hidden&quot;,&quot;style=margin-top: 3rem; height: 40rem; width: 70rem; align-self: flex-start; align-items: flex-start; justify-content: flex-start;&quot;,256,240,&quot;*T&quot;,&quot;Products&quot;,257,241,[137],&quot;/&quot;,258,242,[137],&quot;Local Business License Issuing System&quot;,259,243,[117],&quot;style=color: rgb(33, 91, 115); font-size: 2.5rem; margin: 0rem;&quot;,260,243,259,[92],&quot;style=font-size: 3.75rem; font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.3; margin: 1.5rem 0rem;&quot;,261,244,&quot;IMG&quot;,&quot;src=https://digit-sandbox-prod-s3.s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/assets/5e72d0b559dea9fc2f5ff2bd4c66c63c3aff8bcc.png&quot;,&quot;style=height: 100%; width: auto; object-fit: contain; min-height: 35rem;&quot;,262,245,[117],&quot;class=about-title&quot;,263,245,262,[5],&quot;class=title-underline&quot;,264,246,[137],&quot;The Local Business License Issuing system is an end-to-end product built using DIGIT that enables &quot;,265,246,264,&quot;STRONG&quot;,266,246,265,[137],&quot; and &quot;,267,246,266,[177],268,246,267,[137],&quot; and issue license certificates based on local regulations. This product is &quot;,269,246,268,&quot;EM&quot;,270,246,269,[137],&quot; and can be extended to support a wide range of licenses, permits and certificates.&quot;,271,246,270,&quot;BR&quot;,272,246,271,[204],273,246,272,[137],&quot;Each product on DIGIT allows specific roles to be assigned to each user. The default workflow has two types of users: Citizen and Government Employee.&quot;,274,247,[5],&quot;class=roles-section&quot;,275,248,[117,164],276,248,275,[5],&quot;class=title-underline-2&quot;,277,249,[137],&quot;On Sandbox, the product can be experienced end-to end, from creating an application as a citizen to approving it as an government employee. The government employee has been set up as a super-user, with all government employee roles being assigned to it. For each user, a new browser tab will open with the appropriate interface. Please do not share any sensitive or private details as this instance is shared across users.&quot;,278,250,[5],&quot;class=cs-wrapper&quot;,279,251,[5,233],280,252,[137],&quot;Walkthrough on Sandbox&quot;,281,253,[137],&quot;Learn how to navigate and use the product on Sandbox.&quot;,282,254,[5],&quot;class=wt-tab active&quot;,283,254,282,[5],&quot;class=wt-tab &quot;,284,255,&quot;IFRAME&quot;,&quot;src=https://app.supademo.com/embed/cmc4n9fdm021uyj0ictnkvmqy?embed_v=2&quot;,&quot;class=wt-iframe&quot;,&quot;style=width: 100%; height: 600px;&quot;,&quot;*O=true&quot;,285,259,[137,146],286,260,[69],&quot;style=color: rgb(33, 91, 115);&quot;,287,260,286,[69],&quot;style=color: rgb(200, 76, 14);&quot;,288,260,287,[69,267],289,262,[137],&quot;About Local Business License Issuing System&quot;,290,265,[137],&quot;citizens (businesses owners) to apply for licenses&quot;,291,267,[137],&quot;government employees to ensure compliance&quot;,292,269,[137],&quot;fully configurable&quot;,293,274,[5],&quot;class=role-block&quot;,294,274,293,[5,296],295,275,[137],&quot;Local Business Issuing System on Sandbox&quot;,296,278,[5],&quot;class=cs-left&quot;,297,278,296,[5],&quot;class=cs-right cs-justify-end&quot;,298,279,[5],&quot;class=cs-right cs-justify-start&quot;,299,279,298,[5,308],300,282,[137],&quot;Citizen&quot;,301,283,[137],&quot;Govt.  Employee&quot;,303,286,[137],&quot;Get your&quot;,304,286,303,[137],&quot; &quot;,305,287,[137],&quot;business license issued&quot;,306,287,305,[137,338],307,288,[137],&quot;easily&quot;,308,288,307,[137,338],309,293,[5],&quot;class=role-icon-wrapper&quot;,310,293,309,[92],311,294,[5,358],312,294,311,[92],313,296,[117],&quot;class=cs-title&quot;,314,296,313,[5],&quot;class=cs-card&quot;,315,296,314,[5,378],316,296,315,[5,378],317,296,316,[5,378],318,296,317,[5,378],319,296,318,[5,378],320,296,319,&quot;BUTTON&quot;,&quot;class=cs-button&quot;,321,297,[158],&quot;src=https://digit-sandbox-prod-s3.s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/assets/b49b43c60c88ed87c0a54cf6dc06b26ce83c1bcf.png&quot;,&quot;class=cs-image&qu